WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.040 --> 01:39.980
Episode 22:
Surviving the Underground

02:03.560 --> 02:07.340
It feels so good. The air is much fresher here than in Paris.

02:07.360 --> 02:09.390
You like the countryside, don't you, Remy?

02:09.410 --> 02:12.070
Because I grew up in a place like this.

02:12.210 --> 02:14.880
I'm looking forward to seeing the farm.

02:15.710 --> 02:19.040
I don't get how you can be so optimistic.

02:19.070 --> 02:19.960
Huh?

02:20.290 --> 02:23.000
After we get to the farm, we just pick grapes from morning 'til the night.

02:23.490 --> 02:27.460
Every year, when fall comes, we're taken to do grape picking.

02:27.530 --> 02:30.000
It's much easier working in Paris.

02:31.740 --> 02:33.500
Grape picking?

02:37.150 --> 02:39.520
I'm thirsty. Stop here.

02:49.550 --> 02:53.110
You, young man, are you listening?!

02:53.370 --> 02:59.650
Since the coal mine closed, it's been so quiet.

03:00.170 --> 03:03.610
There was no better miner than me!

03:09.740 --> 03:13.860
Marcel, you seem so excited.
- There's cows...

03:13.860 --> 03:17.790
Maybe we'll get a chance to have some milk or something.

03:18.000 --> 03:20.310
No way.

03:42.570 --> 03:44.070
Thank you, Mattia.

03:50.690 --> 03:52.020
Use this.

03:53.760 --> 03:54.530
Here.

04:05.500 --> 04:06.490
Let's go.

04:07.020 --> 04:09.130
Capi! Joli-Coeur!

04:10.700 --> 04:11.980
What's wrong?

04:28.350 --> 04:29.650
Is someone there?

04:29.790 --> 04:31.660
Is someone in there?

04:39.060 --> 04:40.260
Mattia...

04:42.590 --> 04:44.520
Capi, wait here.

05:00.690 --> 05:02.510
Is someone there?

05:04.370 --> 05:05.790
Where are you?

05:14.190 --> 05:15.870
What are you doing here?

05:16.630 --> 05:19.740
I got lost on my way back.

05:19.760 --> 05:22.610
The boys were exploring.

05:22.620 --> 05:24.760
I... I...

05:26.900 --> 05:29.170
It's all right. Don't cry.

05:29.200 --> 05:30.900
Come on, let's go.

05:31.770 --> 05:32.630
Oh...

05:37.000 --> 05:38.360
Let's get out of here.

05:56.640 --> 05:57.870
<i>Falling rocks?</i>

05:58.570 --> 06:01.490
What was that?
- What happened?

06:02.020 --> 06:03.130
Ah...

06:13.670 --> 06:16.640
Joli-Coeur, good. You're safe.

06:19.290 --> 06:20.400
Big sister.

06:21.130 --> 06:23.300
Are you all right? Are you hurt?
- No...

06:23.320 --> 06:24.400
Good.

06:30.630 --> 06:32.450
Oh...! The exit...

06:45.410 --> 06:46.720
That's not good.

06:54.890 --> 06:58.180
Remy's inside.

07:14.440 --> 07:16.320
We can't do anything by ourselves.

07:16.350 --> 07:18.360
Let's go to the village and get help.

07:26.940 --> 07:29.910
This year's grapes are great.
- Yup...

07:31.900 --> 07:34.240
Thank you for waiting.
- It's terrible!

07:34.600 --> 07:36.100
Everyone, come on!

07:36.890 --> 07:38.100
What's happened?

07:40.260 --> 07:42.050
Remy's been trapped in the abandoned coal mine.

07:42.070 --> 07:43.060
What did you say?

07:43.080 --> 07:44.110
Where did you find that hat?

07:45.090 --> 07:47.570
It was at the entrance of the abandoned coal mine.

07:48.670 --> 07:50.840
Oh, dear...
- Oh my god.

07:50.840 --> 07:52.810
I told her not to go to the abandoned coal mine.

07:57.970 --> 08:02.320
Help! We're in here! In here!

08:08.750 --> 08:10.430
It'll be all right.

08:10.780 --> 08:12.920
They'll come and save us.

08:12.960 --> 08:15.740
Just be patient for a bit. Hang in there.

08:16.500 --> 08:20.280
<i>Mattia, hurry...
Hurry and help us.</i>

08:24.890 --> 08:26.740
Is there only one exit?

08:27.470 --> 08:28.480
I don't know.

08:29.650 --> 08:31.480
I see.

08:31.980 --> 08:36.300
Is that your monkey?
- Yes, his name is Joli-Coeur.

08:36.320 --> 08:38.360
He's a good friend.
- Yup.

08:38.810 --> 08:41.940
Oh yeah, I haven't asked you your name yet.

08:41.960 --> 08:44.380
My name's Remy. What's yours?
- Jeanne.

08:45.120 --> 08:48.550
All right, Jeanne.
Let's find another exit.

08:48.730 --> 08:49.890
Okay.

08:59.130 --> 09:00.720
All right, there we go.

09:29.500 --> 09:31.810
We can't go any farther.

09:31.830 --> 09:35.340
We're done for.
We're never gonna survive.

09:36.570 --> 09:38.100
Hang in there, Jeanne.

09:38.120 --> 09:40.270
Someone will come to rescue us, for sure.

09:40.290 --> 09:44.110
Then get me out of here now!
Help me now!

09:48.620 --> 09:52.360
Help us, help us, Mattia.

09:56.310 --> 09:57.400
Remy...

09:59.080 --> 10:01.780
Hang in there, hang in there for me.

10:02.200 --> 10:03.320
Look out!

10:08.080 --> 10:10.790
Jeanne! Jeanne! Answer me!

10:21.410 --> 10:23.600
Let's go back to where we were and wait.

10:24.150 --> 10:26.560
They'll come to help us.

10:35.940 --> 10:37.080
What's wrong, Joli-Coeur?

10:46.030 --> 10:49.300
A rescue! Someone's coming to help!
- Dad!

10:54.820 --> 10:57.990
Over here! We're over here!

11:04.310 --> 11:06.750
Jeanne! Remy! Are you there?

11:07.600 --> 11:10.290
Dad!
- Jeanne!

11:10.580 --> 11:14.240
Good. Now, come over here.
- Yes, Jeanne.

11:18.470 --> 11:20.820
Jeanne, thank goodness.

11:20.840 --> 11:23.700
Hurry up, Remy.
- Okay!

11:26.560 --> 11:27.970
Look out!

11:48.920 --> 11:50.020
Where's Remy?

11:50.910 --> 11:52.860
Back there.

11:53.290 --> 11:57.610
When she was getting out, the ceiling caved in. It happened so fast.

11:58.620 --> 12:00.240
Hey, hang in there.

12:02.610 --> 12:04.080
Remy's dead.

12:05.540 --> 12:07.920
It can't be!

12:28.940 --> 12:31.640
Big sister! Big sister!

12:32.450 --> 12:35.650
We did the best we could.
- Yeah.

12:38.060 --> 12:40.720
Remy got herself into this mess.

12:40.930 --> 12:44.920
Everyone, let's go. We have to get to the vineyard today.

12:44.970 --> 12:47.910
Now, hurry up.
- She's alive.

12:49.170 --> 12:51.490
What did you say?
- Remy's alive.

12:51.770 --> 12:54.940
Be reasonable. She can't be alive.

12:58.470 --> 13:00.000
She's alive!

13:00.930 --> 13:02.680
Knock it off!

13:03.770 --> 13:05.160
Are you all right?

13:05.850 --> 13:07.800
You! That was uncalled for!

13:07.920 --> 13:11.470
It's none of your business. Let's go!
- No!

13:14.010 --> 13:14.980
What?

13:15.280 --> 13:17.160
I'm not going without Remy.

13:17.250 --> 13:19.230
Me either.
- We have to find Remy.

13:19.820 --> 13:23.040
What did you say?
- We have to find Remy.

13:23.080 --> 13:25.310
Right!
- R... Right!

13:27.470 --> 13:30.080
You...
- Oh yes!

13:30.400 --> 13:33.730
Let's ask Mr. Belconnu.

13:33.750 --> 13:34.670
Yeah.

13:35.560 --> 13:37.080
Mr. Belconnu?

13:42.560 --> 13:43.090
Mister!

13:43.580 --> 13:45.200
Wake up! Mister!

13:47.370 --> 13:48.640
It's no use.

13:48.730 --> 13:52.890
He might not look it, but he used to be a miner in the village.

13:53.230 --> 13:55.100
Maybe he'd have an idea.

13:56.810 --> 13:59.860
Mister! Mister! Wake up!

14:07.840 --> 14:10.090
What are you doing!?

14:11.080 --> 14:14.660
Please, you have to help Remy!
- What?

14:32.910 --> 14:35.560
Are you sure we can find Remy?

14:35.770 --> 14:37.710
Yeah, trust me.

14:52.000 --> 14:52.740
Oh...

14:53.510 --> 14:54.990
What's wrong?

14:58.720 --> 15:01.140
This side is also caved in.

15:01.360 --> 15:02.970
No way...

15:03.640 --> 15:04.970
We can't get through.

15:05.850 --> 15:09.730
We have to give up. The girl couldn't have survived that.

15:11.050 --> 15:12.230
Remy...

15:18.260 --> 15:19.420
Remy...

15:21.030 --> 15:21.730
Remy!

15:27.840 --> 15:29.740
What are you doing?

15:32.890 --> 15:35.520
The girl, Remy, she's alive.

15:35.540 --> 15:37.390
Why aren't we trying to dig her out?

15:37.410 --> 15:40.540
Mister...
- Trust me.

15:58.220 --> 15:59.670
Joli-Coeur.

16:06.210 --> 16:07.140
Ouch!

16:08.580 --> 16:11.570
I think my ankle's twisted.

16:28.080 --> 16:31.260
We're done for.
We can't get out of here.

16:31.780 --> 16:33.250
We'll never see them again.

16:52.620 --> 16:54.910
We can't stay here. We have to go.

17:03.190 --> 17:05.460
Let's find an exit, Joli-Coeur.

17:05.490 --> 17:08.020
Mattia will be looking for us, I know it.

17:23.110 --> 17:27.020
I'm all right. I'm fine, Joli-Coeur. See?

17:27.880 --> 17:36.680
Mother, mother, my mother

17:37.140 --> 17:43.360
Your gentle hugs holding me, when I'm...

17:51.960 --> 17:54.450
Remy! Remy!
- It's dangerous!

17:54.480 --> 17:55.930
Run!
- No!

17:56.450 --> 17:58.930
Remy is behind this pile of rocks.
We have to rescue her.

17:59.340 --> 18:01.950
Remy! Remy!

18:02.250 --> 18:03.270
Come on!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.880
Remy! Remy!

18:51.470 --> 18:54.600
<i>Help me...
Help me, Mattia.</i>

19:14.250 --> 19:15.320
Remy!

19:15.430 --> 19:18.270
Remy, if you can hear this, answer me!

19:19.240 --> 19:20.140
Remy!

19:31.170 --> 19:32.460
Joli-Coeur.

19:32.610 --> 19:34.650
That sound is Mattia calling me.

19:37.270 --> 19:38.870
Mattia!

19:38.910 --> 19:40.820
I'm here!

19:41.490 --> 19:42.910
Mattia!

19:42.980 --> 19:44.850
Mattia!

19:46.160 --> 19:47.410
Remy!

19:53.680 --> 19:54.450
What?

19:59.450 --> 20:00.360
It's Remy...

20:00.390 --> 20:02.720
What!?
- Remy's there!

20:17.070 --> 20:19.320
Mattia... It's over.

20:20.830 --> 20:22.700
Sorry, Joli-Coeur.

20:38.950 --> 20:39.760
Remy!

20:40.160 --> 20:41.400
Remy!

20:41.830 --> 20:42.910
Mattia...

20:45.970 --> 20:46.980
Remy...

20:48.070 --> 20:50.770
Mattia! Mattia!

20:51.160 --> 20:52.390
Remy!

21:02.360 --> 21:03.160
Remy...

21:06.420 --> 21:07.650
Mattia!

21:15.200 --> 21:17.500
Everyone! Remy's been rescued!

21:18.050 --> 21:23.680
Great! Great!

21:28.880 --> 21:29.940
Thank goodness.

21:30.230 --> 21:31.560
Thank goodness, Remy.

21:31.580 --> 21:36.020
I knew you would come.
I just knew you would come.

21:40.530 --> 21:48.830
Try to love yourself more

21:49.870 --> 21:59.110
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

21:59.420 --> 22:08.530
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:09.090 --> 22:20.030
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:20.440 --> 22:30.360
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:30.500 --> 22:40.000
From the future that gives us our fate

22:40.260 --> 22:49.550
Try to seek for them more

22:49.900 --> 22:53.790
Give your heart to

22:53.840 --> 23:06.810
That person who is also seeking you

23:19.000 --> 23:22.380
I want to be a violinist.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.660
If I go with him...

23:25.040 --> 23:27.060
Huh? No way!

23:27.150 --> 23:30.370
Mattia's not someone who'd abandon us.

23:30.800 --> 23:33.970
I don't mind. I don't mind if Mattia doesn't mind.

23:34.000 --> 23:38.770
<i>Both of their Wishes</i>

23:34.000 --> 23:38.770
Next time:
